{
"#name"
:
{
"tz"
:
null
,
"en"
:
"Time Zone Assistant"
,
"cn"
:
"时区助手"
}
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"一致地获取系统时区信息（缩写、名称、UTC 偏移），跨平台查看与切换时区"
,
"en"
:
"Consistent access to system timezone information (abbreviation, name, UTC offset) across platforms"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
"x tz"
,
"x tz info"
,
"x tz abbr"
,
"x tz name"
,
"x tz offset"
,
"x tz ls --[csv|tsv|raw]"
,
"x tz id <keyword>..."
,
"x tz loc set <zone>"
,
"x tz loc get"
,
"x tz fz"
,
"x tz init"
]
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"tz 模块封装 [tz](github.com/oz/tz) 命令并使用 fzf 提供交互式浏览；底层时区数据库由系统 tzdata 提供"
,
"en"
:
"The tz module wraps the [tz](github.com/oz/tz) command and uses fzf for interactive browsing; timezone data comes from the system tzdata"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"`x tz offset` 会优先读取缓存 `~/.x-cmd/data/tz/offset`；系统时区变更后运行 `x tz init` 强制刷新"
,
"en"
:
"`x tz offset` reads the cache file `~/.x-cmd/data/tz/offset` first; run `x tz init` to force a refresh after the system timezone changes"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"缩写、名称与偏移三者中至少有一个能识别当前时区；当 `tz` 后端不可用时，offset 会回退到 `date +%z`"
,
"en"
:
"At least one of abbreviation, name, and offset is available; when the tz backend is missing, offset falls back to `date +%z`"
}
]
,
"#subcmd:View"
:
[
"info|i"
,
"abbr"
,
"name"
,
"offset"
]
,
"info|i"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"一行显示缩写、名称与 UTC 偏移"
,
"en"
:
"Show abbreviation, name, and UTC offset on one line"
}
}
,
"abbr"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"显示当前时区的缩写（如 CST）"
,
"en"
:
"Display the current timezone abbreviation (e.g. CST)"
}
}
,
"name"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"显示当前时区的 Olson 名称（如 Asia/Shanghai）"
,
"en"
:
"Display the current timezone Olson name (e.g. Asia/Shanghai)"
}
}
,
"offset"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"显示当前时区相对 UTC 的偏移，格式为 ±hhmm"
,
"en"
:
"Display the current timezone offset from UTC in ±hhmm format"
}
}
,
"#subcmd:List"
:
[
"ls"
,
"id"
,
"fz"
]
,
"ls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"列出所有时区"
,
"en"
:
"List all timezones"
}
,
"--csv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"以 CSV 格式输出"
,
"en"
:
"Output in CSV format"
}
}
,
"--tsv"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"以 TSV 格式输出（默认）"
,
"en"
:
"Output in TSV format (default)"
}
}
,
"--raw"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"以底层 tz -list 原始输出"
,
"en"
:
"Output raw tz -list output"
}
}
}
,
"id"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"按关键字查找时区（Olson 名称、地区或缩写，逗号分隔）"
,
"en"
:
"Look up timezones by keyword (Olson name, region, or abbreviation, comma-separated)"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"关键字（逗号分隔）"
,
"en"
:
"Keyword (comma-separated)"
}
}
}
,
"fz"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"使用 fzf 交互式浏览所有时区"
,
"en"
:
"Interactively browse all timezones via fzf"
}
}
,
"#subcmd:Config"
:
[
"loc|set|get"
]
,
"loc|set"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"保存时区配置到默认 profile"
,
"en"
:
"Save the timezone configuration to the default profile"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"时区（Olson 名称或缩写）"
,
"en"
:
"Timezone (Olson name or abbreviation)"
}
}
}
,
"loc|get"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"读取保存的时区配置"
,
"en"
:
"Read the saved timezone configuration"
}
}
,
"#subcmd:Maintenance"
:
[
"init"
]
,
"init"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"强制重新解析 /etc/localtime 并刷新缓存的时区偏移"
,
"en"
:
"Force re-parsing of /etc/localtime and refresh the cached timezone offset"
}
}
,
"<--exec|--"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"调用底层 [tz](github.com/oz/tz) 的原生命令（如 -when、-m、-q、-list）"
,
"en"
:
"Invoke the underlying [tz](github.com/oz/tz) native command (e.g. -when, -m, -q, -list)"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"传递给 tz 的参数"
,
"en"
:
"Arguments forwarded to tz"
}
}
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x tz"
,
"cn"
:
"一行显示缩写、名称与 UTC 偏移"
,
"en"
:
"Show abbreviation, name, and UTC offset on one line"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x tz offset"
,
"cn"
:
"仅查看当前时区的 UTC 偏移"
,
"en"
:
"Just view the current timezone UTC offset"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x tz ls --csv"
,
"cn"
:
"以 CSV 格式列出所有时区"
,
"en"
:
"List all timezones in CSV format"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x tz id shanghai,new_york"
,
"cn"
:
"按关键字查找时区"
,
"en"
:
"Look up timezones by keyword"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x tz fz"
,
"cn"
:
"使用 fzf 交互式浏览所有时区"
,
"en"
:
"Interactively browse all timezones with fzf"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x tz loc set Asia/Tokyo"
,
"cn"
:
"保存时区配置到默认 profile"
,
"en"
:
"Save the timezone configuration to the default profile"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x tz loc get"
,
"cn"
:
"读取保存的时区配置"
,
"en"
:
"Read the saved timezone configuration"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x tz init"
,
"cn"
:
"系统时区变更后强制刷新时区缓存"
,
"en"
:
"Force-refresh the timezone cache after the system timezone changes"
}
]
,
"#other"
:
{
"en"
:
{
"Please visit our homepage for more information:"
:
"https://x-cmd.com/mod"
}
,
"cn"
:
{
"请访问我们的主页以获取更多信息："
:
"https://x-cmd.com/mod"
}
}
}

